-  - id: exp3823-trm-not-ebt-curlfree
-    operator_override: >
-      2026-06-04 operator directive (recursive-refiner thesis, net-new DT-P2 falsification):
-      NOT a rerun of Thesis-A EBT bring-up. Distinct deterministic test — fit a scalar energy to a
-      trained TRM's latent updates under the curl-free constraint; failure PROVES TRM expresses an
-      asymmetric vector field EBT cannot, so the bounded-EBT result does not cover TRM.
-    milestone: "2026.06.351"
-    title: "DT-P2 falsification: energy-fit to a trained TRM's latent updates Δh under the curl-free constraint (Δh ≈ −∇E(h)) — confirm TRM ≠ EBT (asymmetric vector field, not energy descent)."
-    priority: high
-    track: research
-    max_turns: 40
-    agent_type: codex
-    model: gpt-5.5
-    requires_codex: true   # formulaic numerical: Jacobian-symmetry / Helmholtz-decomposition test + least-squares energy fit; well-defined correctness criterion (curl residual), no open-ended judgment
-    requires_gpu: false
-    estimated_wall_time_min: 30
-    inference_substrate: aggregation_from_upstream_artifacts   # consumes exp3821's trained-TRM latents/updates; numerical fit, no new model inference beyond replaying captured Δh
-    gated_on:
-      - upstream: exp3821-latent-symbol-bridge-unblocked
-        artifact_field: trm_checkpoint_source
-        op: not_contains
-        value: "none"
-    deliverable: results/experiment_3823_trm_not_ebt_curlfree.json
-    prompt: |
-      CONTEXT. Deep Think P2 (95%, strongest defense of the pivot): EBT's inference update field is
-      mathematically restricted to be CONSERVATIVE (curl-free; the gradient of a scalar energy, so
-      its Jacobian is symmetric). TRM learns a GENERIC discrete-time dynamical system — an arbitrary
-      (asymmetric) vector field — so it can express conditional logic / asymmetric attractors / limit
-      cycles EBT is mathematically INCAPABLE of. Therefore our bounded EBT result does NOT cover TRM.
-      Falsification: capture a trained TRM's latent updates Δh = h_{{t+1}} − h_t over many states, then
-      try to fit a scalar E(h) such that Δh ≈ −∇E(h). The curl-free / symmetric-Jacobian constraint
-      should make this FAIL (large curl residual). If it SUCCEEDS, TRM is secretly energy descent
-      (also a valuable, surprising finding). Framing: docs/research-notes/phase3-recursive-refiner-thesis.md
-      (§"Revised plan", TASK 0.5b + P2).
-
-      EXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:
-        - docs/research-notes/phase3-recursive-refiner-thesis.md (P2, TASK 0.5b)
-        - results/experiment_3821_latent_symbol_bridge_unblocked.json (the trained TRM + checkpoint source)
-        - research-references.md (.351: 2512.15605 ARM-EBM bijection — the theory frame)
-
